{"id":"n25069-1-9","stage":3,"title":"적히다 · 被写下","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25069-1-9-1","ko":"내가 자리 비우는 동안 혹시 전화 왔었나?","zh":"我不在的这段时间里，有电话打进来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"자리","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}},{"text":"비우는","meaning":"不在，离开","explanation":"비우다：不在，离开；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"비우다","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15631","senseId":"3","lemma":"비우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비우는","audio":"/audio/defb2060aa0b8d639c89.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"전화","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}},{"text":"왔었나?","meaning":"来，到","explanation":"오다：来，到；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"4","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔었나","audio":"/audio/44cff77be9b10c27dba2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"e1f74ccf9cd9d475","term":"비우다","zh":"不在，离开","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3","entryId":"15631","definition":"从自己所负责的职位或职责中暂时脱离出来。","pronunciation":["비우다"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"东西、权利等转向某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0d6691b424016f992e2e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25069-1-9-2","ko":"네. 여기 종이에 적힌 전화번호로 연락을 해 보세요.","zh":"有的。请试着用这里纸上的电话号码联系他们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，好的（礼貌的肯定应答）","explanation":"네：是，好的（礼貌的肯定应答）","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"종이에","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종이에","audio":"/audio/8c9b579124c12050fc64.mp3"}},{"text":"적힌","meaning":"被写下","explanation":"적히다：被写下；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"적히다","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25069","senseId":"1","lemma":"적히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적힌","audio":"/audio/42da0ee3d508225a7b82.mp3"}},{"text":"전화번호로","meaning":"电话号码","explanation":"전화번호：电话号码；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"전화번호","audio":"/audio/4edc94394feec0a6ca6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58153","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화번호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화번호로","audio":"/audio/9dad63a7148d78eb76c6.mp3"}},{"text":"연락을","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락을","audio":"/audio/8656320bd794bb5740d9.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，好的（礼貌的肯定应答）","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"是，好的（礼貌的肯定应答）","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"7998eec620b7e3cc","term":"적히다","zh":"被写下","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3","entryId":"25069","definition":"被用文字记下来。","pronunciation":["저키다"]},{"id":"4edc94394feec0a6","term":"전화번호","zh":"电话号码","audio":"/audio/4edc94394feec0a6ca6b.mp3","entryId":"58153","definition":"各电话机固有的号码。","pronunciation":["전ː화번호"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/88eb278431a0cc7e4a5a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.153,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25069","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7506,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不在的这段时间里，有电话打进来吗？","有的。请试着用这里纸上的电话号码联系他们。","你们的侄子真可爱。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不在的这段时间里，有电话打进来吗？","有的。请试着用这里纸上的电话号码联系他们。","你们的侄子真可爱。"],"answer":1}]}
